                "richTextValue" : "<h2>Additional Information</h2>\n\n<h3>Location</h3>\n\n<p>Meet at Hsu’s Ginseng Enterprises, 237895 County Rd W, Wausau, WI 54403.</p>\n\n<br>\n<h3>Preparation</h3>\n\n<p>Please remember to dress appropriately for the weather. We highly recommend wearing shoes and clothing that you don't mind getting dirty.</p>"
