                    "isLinkable" : false,
                    "linkAssistiveText" : "",
                    "paddingHorizontal" : "none",
                    "paddingVertical" : "none",
                    "text" : "At Hsu’s Ginseng, we have a brokerage and export business process built on over 50 years of trust and personal relationships with local farmers and foreign buyers. You will learn how Paul Hsu started this process in the basement of his home. Our headquarters is also home to our production area for many of our packaged products found on Chinatown store shelves and airport gift shops. You will understand production challenges as well as discover our products.",
                    "textAlign" : "left",
                    "textDecoration" : "{}",
                    "textDisplayInfo" : "{\"textStyle\":\"heading-xsmall\",\"headingTag\":\"h5\"}"
